/workspace/Base/Klean153StrongestExtension/Prelude.lean:7:Currently we translate hooked functions as uninterpreted functions together with axioms asserting their behavior.
/workspace/Base/Klean153StrongestExtension/Prelude.lean:14:The behavior of the uninterpreted symbols can be asserted through axioms or theorems.
/workspace/Base/Klean153StrongestExtension/Prelude.lean:15:Inconsistencies can arise from them, so it falls under the user to make sure axioms are consistent and/or theorems provable.
