The launcher failure is environmental, not a Lean error: this Lean build resolves its executable through `/proc/<getpid>/exe`, while the runner exposes only `/proc/self/exe` for the active process namespace. I’m applying a temporary read-only execution shim that redirects only that lookup; it does not alter the pinned toolchain, project, target, or proof sources.
